S Datamatrix, QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF417, Micro PDF 417, etc.<\/li><li><b>CONEXIONES&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>USB<\/li><li><b>ESPECIFICACIONES F\u00cdSICAS<\/b><\/li><li>Dimensiones: (LxWxH): 125 x 88 x 100mm.<\/li><li>Peso: 235 g. aprox.<\/li><li>Color: Blanco y negro<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/p>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_app-lector%20appls20desk%20p_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"39.50","unit_price_tax":46.5},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8435099530916"],"reference":"APPLS20DESK+","name":{"1":"Lector de C\u00f3digo de Barras 1D-2D-PDF-QR Approx appLS20DESK+\/ USB","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<p><p><\/p><h2>appLS20DESK+<\/h2><p>El appLS20DESK+ es un lector de c\u00f3digos de barras 1D\/2D USB que busca elevar el rendimiento del tiempo de cobro, mejorar la experiencia del cliente y una mejor ejecuci\u00f3n de los programas de marketing m\u00f3vil. Destaca su capacidad de escaneo sobre pantallas de tablets o smartphones, su alto brillo y escaneo en ambientes oscuros.<\/p><p>No necesita drivers y es detectado por el PC autom\u00e1ticamente. Es configurable, admite dise\u00f1os de distintos teclados e incluye LED y timbre para indicar estados de lectura.<\/p><p><\/p><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><p><ul><li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas<\/b><\/li><li>Tipo: CMOS, fuente de luz 5600K LEDs<\/li><li>Modo de escaneo: 1D\/2D Imager<\/li><li>Velocidad de escaneo: 30fps<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n: 640*480<\/li><li>Profundidad de \u00e1rea de escaneo: 0-300mm<\/li><li>Modo de lectura: autom\u00e1tico (auto detecci\u00f3n de objetos) o continuo<\/li><li>Precisi\u00f3n de lectura: &#8805;5mil\/0.127mm<\/li><li>Tensi\u00f3n de entrada: 5V DC +5%<\/li><li>\u00c1ngulo de escaneo: Pitch:\u00b145\u00b0 \/ Roll: \u00b1360\u00b0 \/ Skew: \u00b140\u00b0<\/li><li>Capacidad de decodificacion: C\u00f3digo de barras 1D como UPC-A, UPC-E, EAN-8, EAN-13, Code 128, GS1-128, Code 39, Code 93, Code 11, Interleaved 2 of 5, Matrix 2 of 5, Industrial 2 of 5, Strande 2 of 5, Codabar (NW-7), MSI Plessey, GS1 Databar (RSS), China Post, etc. \/ c\u00f3digo de barras 2D como GS Datamatrix, QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF417, Micro PDF 417, etc.<\/li><li><b>CONEXIONES&nbsp;<\/b><\/li><li>USB<\/li><li><b>ESPECIFICACIONES F\u00cdSICAS<\/b><\/li><li>Dimensiones: (LxWxH): 125 x 88 x 100mm.<\/li><li>Peso: 235 g. aprox.<\/li><li>Color: Blanco y negro<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"APPROX","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.43,"unit_price":46.5,"unit_price_tax":46.5,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Terminal Pto Venta TPV","sub_category":"Lectores codigos barra","quantity":5,"brand":"APPROX","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_app-lector%20appls20desk%20p_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":39.5}}},"8447071001642":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8447071001642",false],"wholesale_price":[553.88,false],"price":[560.88,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 4.93",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:256032","Cat. IDs: 192","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 192","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/24d18dfa1f1c0d37e6f44e724d9d098e.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"TPV Premier KT-100 FT Intel i5-10310\/ 8GB\/ 128GB SSD\/ 15.6'\/ T\u00e1ctil\/ Win10 IoT","category":"Terminal Pto Venta TPV","sub_category":"